=== 6. Demonstrate salt difference with hash-with-salt ===
Command: ./salted_password_hash hash-with-salt "mypassword" "aabbccdd"
Output : 96f78136f70e2330e29387d9ae14e64dbf52de74cca6f36e3355faad7f9f409c

Command: ./salted_password_hash hash-with-salt "mypassword" "11223344"
